        /**
         * A Boolean value that indicates whether the orbiting object updates its orientation during the animation to orient itself along the rotation path.
         * @param value A Boolean value that indicates whether the orbiting object updates its orientation during the animation to orient itself along the rotation path.
         * @return The reference to this animation is returned, so you can
         * \since API Level 1
         */
